  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Moment of inertia of disc is given by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>MR</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#961;</mi><mfenced><msup><mi>&#960;R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac></mfenced><mn>4</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>16</mn><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;</p>",
